  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that configurations using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (e.g., config_027) achieve high accuracy. This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder with pca_n2000 while keeping the same image encoder, aggregation, and fusion methods could yield similar or better performance. It clarifies the importance of the RNA encoder choice, which remains a key uncertainty. This is the best use of the next experiment to explore a critical design choice with potential for improvement."
